<h2 id="featured">Get featured</h2>
<p>Featured placements put your connector at the top of its category and in the weekly newsletter. They're <b>always labelled "Featured"</b> and never change a status badge: badges come only from our checks.</p>
<p><a class="btn" href="mailto:{{ site.contact }}?subject=Featured%20listing">Ask about featured listings</a></p>
